            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 nyt-grid-col">
            <div class="nyt-grid-item">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?sig=106" alt="Art">
                <h4>Festîvala fîlman a îsal amadekariyên xwe temam kir</h4>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 nyt-grid-col">
            <div class="nyt-grid-item">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?sig=107" alt="Art">
                <h4>Pirtûka nû ya helbestvan gihîşt ber destê xwendevanan</h4>
